"report the error code and the English version of the error message (e.g. "
"\"Bad request\"). Your file should also be valid HTML.</p>"
"<p>The strings ERROR_MESSAGE, ERROR_CODE and RESOURCE, if they exist in the "
"file, will be replaced with the English error message, the numeric error "
"code and the path of the requested resource, respectively.</p>"
